# vehje-check. shame

Known gaps in the shipped check pass.

## Mutable-consumer lease inference

The shipped lease inference computes the immutable strictly-nested depth-lease
floor only: it proves region validity for the immutable core and much of the
aliased case, where the reach-mask collapses to lexical nesting and the
metatheorem is proven cheap. The full reachability qualifier inference (mutable
and escaping values, the avoidance boundary, the per-reference generational
residual) is not built and is gated on the avoidance-rate experiment, so a
program that mutates or escapes a value past the depth-lease floor is not yet
lease-checked to the full qualifier, only to the floor. This is a deliberate
risk valve, not a hole: the floor ships on a proven metatheorem and the lattice
grows additively, so nothing shipped is unsound, only incomplete toward the
mutable case.
